          %h2#references References
          %p The case of analytic manifolds is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Claude+Chevalley"}> Claude Chevalley
              , Theory of Lie Groups I (Princeton, 1946).
          %p
            The case of
            = succeed "-manifolds" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
